2,"y":1921.14,"cell":6067,"i":106,"name":"Krurasisharand Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳔⳫ⳾⳪Ⳮ⳪ⲾⲼⳬ  ⳌⳲ ⳾ⳖⳒ⳹ⳭⳄ⳥ⳞⳐⲴⳲ ⳩ⳊⳠⲸ Ⳣ⳹Ⳮ ⳊⳊⳈⳬⳄ  ⳃⲾⳜⲾⲾ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":3570.9,"y":3973.63,"cell":15991,"i":107,"name":"Bozkolu Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802𐠬𐠝\udc20\udc0d\udc37\udc08𐠧\udc0b𐠪\udc26\udc2a𐠍\udc0f\ud802𐠱\udc2b\ud802𐠷\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc2f\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":2653.56,"y":4324.25,"cell":17982,"i":108,"name":"Aylinocabe Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༃ༀ༡༶༘༾༕༢༼༜༅༛ༀ༂༰༾༕༵༌༣༧༛༷༽༨༮༘༵༊༘ༀ༤་༁༛༄༨༚༐༶༔༯༪༂༊༕༽༗༼༂༣༌༱༃༜༲༒༰༵༻༙༶༇༃༅༒༵༆</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":12140.41,"y":3897.72,"cell":15938,"i":109,"name":"Wethi Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༫༤༿༌༰༼༺༰༁་༭༡༈༙༬༼༪༗༛༫༜༖༴༿༅༭༦༮༄༕༕༅༌་༉༗༐༼༷༌༠༿༐༣༃</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":2821.42,"y":5284.09,"cell":21948,"i":110,"name":"Kobasun Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">የቀለወረ ሀ ዘሐፐነፀረየፈፀመቀነሠሠለከ ኀደ ከተየበ አጸኀየወነፀየወሠሐየጰረሀ ሰገሀረረወሠበ ሐ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":4107.11,"y":5618.89,"cell":23542,"i":111,"name":"Alazkalani Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc01\ud802 \udc3f\ud802𐠢\udc19𐠩𐠖\ud802𐠩𐠈\udc35𐠿\udc1e𐠊\ud802𐠠\udc0f\ud802\ud802𐠲\udc11\ud802\ud802 𐠢\ud802𐠪  𐠌\ud802𐠠\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠕𐠩 𐠢\udc26𐠞\udc35𐠳\udc31\udc28\udc31𐠬\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":7682.09,"y":4668.7,"cell":19588,"i":112,"name":"Zaram Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc12\udc2e\ud802𐠁\udc2a\udc2c𐠩\ud802\ud802𐠁\ud802𐠈\ud802𐠒 \udc2a𐠱\ud802\ud802 \udc38\ud802\ud802𐠄\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠢\udc10\udc17\udc32\udc27\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠏\udc19\ud802𐠂\udc34\ud802\ud802 𐠦\udc23\ud802\ud802𐠥 \udc21\udc0b\udc0a𐠍\udc1b\ud802𐠟 𐠱𐠑\ud802𐠛𐠈\udc1e\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠌\udc3c𐠧\udc20\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":7022.7,"y":3571.4,"cell":14098,"i":113,"name":"Kart Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠐\ud802\ud802𐠬\udc15\ud802𐠰\udc0e\udc1c\udc28\udc2c\udc2c𐠞\udc02𐠥\udc14\ud802𐠡\ud802𐠦 \udc17\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 𐠲\udc1c\ud802 𐠩\ud802 \udc3f \ud802\ud802\ud802𐠛𐠠𐠠\udc1e\udc18\ud802\ud802𐠥𐠁\ud802𐠪𐠔\udc1f𐠦\udc1f\udc24\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠏 \udc1b𐠪\udc21 \ud802\ud802\ud802𐠊</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1945.6,"y":3119.91,"cell":11783,"i":114,"name":"Kerenkay Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳬⳐⳈⲴ⳧ⳊⳆⳤⳄⳔⲴⳬⳂⳊⲶⳁⳠⳃⲴⲶ Ⳇ⳪ⲶⳊ ⳀⳭ⳾ⳃⲺ⳹ⳫⲴⳒⲲⳁ⳧ⳀⳆⳆⳫⲲⳞⳈⲶⳒⳭⲾⳂ⳩ⲲⳜⳈⲼⳈⳘ⳹Ⳉ⳧ⳢⳄ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1463.41,"y":3125.21,"cell":11773,"i":115,"name":"Vuzyu Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">་༑༯༽༑༉༘༌༢༾༙༕༐༫༡༪༧༘༊༵༴༽༆༯༳༅༫༺༒༂༸༗༴༗༵༦༢༜༴༄༅༃ༀ༣༭༴༦༳༒༠༙༂༹༙༗༮༆༓༖༃༹༷༌༲༥</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1379.2,"y":2576.1,"cell":8933,"i":116,"name":"Akalokevre Monument","note":"An ancient 